                "text": "Today, it was a pleasure to join the reopening of Sportspark, an exciting opportunity for Roosevelt Islanders to partake in a variety of fitness, sports and wellness activities in a newly renovated facility. I look forward to seeing our neighbors on the pickleball court! https://t.co/U8Q7Wi34yJ",
