                "quoted_status_profile_username": "JakeSherman",
                "reply_count": 91,
                "retweet_count": 91,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "House Republicans are planning to jam through a billionaire tax giveaway in the dead of night\u2014paid for by gutting health care, food aid, and other critical programs for millions of American families. \n\nRepublicans continue to advance this bill while Americans sleep because they know it is a callous betrayal of working Americans.",
